{"3055250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gothic Clicker", "steam_appid": 3055250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4813280, 4813290, 4813300, 4813310, 5178980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gothic Clicker</strong> is an ARPG clicker with great possibilities to customise your character and his combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were snatched from the clutches of death by the necromancer Zotania in order to help her gather the bones of chaos and rid the world of the red fog.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unconventional approach to character development offers 5 combat and 5 crafting branches, in each of which a flexible perk system awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's cold weapons or wizardry, hunting or herbalism, or maybe all of them at once - it's up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inventory and Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons with minerals, brew potions, wear rings, armour and amulets. You can wear 10 rings at a time, and you can combine them to become Rings of Power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebirth and Astral</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul is in the astral plane. You are neither alive nor dead. By reincarnating, you strengthen your soul and become stronger. Alchemists' sigils and gifts from the awakened will help turn the tide of battle, and venturing into the ocean will attract the gaze of the gods, opening access to powerful soul threads.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the power of the Philosopher's Stone and gold, weapons, magic runes, etc. can be upgraded directly during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its own set of techniques, which can also be pumped and combined at will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholy shamanic music  composed by Stanislav Belyaev emphasises the decadence and depth of Gothic Clicker's bleak world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gothic Clicker</strong> is an ARPG clicker with great possibilities to customise your character and his combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were snatched from the clutches of death by the necromancer Zotania in order to help her gather the bones of chaos and rid the world of the red fog.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unconventional approach to character development offers 5 combat and 5 crafting branches, in each of which a flexible perk system awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's cold weapons or wizardry, hunting or herbalism, or maybe all of them at once - it's up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inventory and Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons with minerals, brew potions, wear rings, armour and amulets. You can wear 10 rings at a time, and you can combine them to become Rings of Power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebirth and Astral</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul is in the astral plane. You are neither alive nor dead. By reincarnating, you strengthen your soul and become stronger. Alchemists' sigils and gifts from the awakened will help turn the tide of battle, and venturing into the ocean will attract the gaze of the gods, opening access to powerful soul threads.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the power of the Philosopher's Stone and gold, weapons, magic runes, etc. can be upgraded directly during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its own set of techniques, which can also be pumped and combined at will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholy shamanic music  composed by Stanislav Belyaev emphasises the decadence and depth of Gothic Clicker's bleak world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Gothic Clicker is a ARPG clicker with an emphasis on combat. Hunt and mine for ore, draw your sword and pray to the gods! Develop combat skills and crafts, upgrade weapons and gain gold. Perform harsh rites of rebirth to become stronger and fight ancient evil.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, French, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055250/header.jpg?t=1788271806", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055250/d7fa932fdf31a3ccf6ad957422d5c536fc050a86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788271806", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055250/d7fa932fdf31a3ccf6ad957422d5c536fc050a86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788271806", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or Intel i3-7100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon HD 7750 or Nvidia GeForce GTX 650</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Illegal Turtle 🐢"], "publishers": ["Illegal Turtle 🐢"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 35, "description": "In-App Purchases"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 76, "description": "Mouse Only Option"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "S